            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "[{\"result\":{\"data\":[{\"id\":\"32fa1d3d-9b2a-43e0-a393-7a3e95511f54\",\"orgId\":\"62f84ee9-c45f-4e41-8868-bcf0bb1ec033\",\"name\":\"EssenRoots\",\"slug\":\"essenroots\",\"websiteUrl\":\"https://essenroot.com/\",\"brandProfile\":{\"logoUrl\":\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/brand-logos/32fa1d3d-9b2a-43e0-a393-7a3e95511f54/569c1fa7-5d60-407d-b6a6-33020620ec35.png\",\"logoStatus\":\"ready\",\"logoSourceUrl\":\"https://essenroot.com/assets/img/logo.png\",\"sellingCountries\":[\"IN\"]},\"createdBy\":\"f5dfb377-dac7-46a6-aea3-a4e04cb45e54\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T16:47:33.315Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-15T16:48:44.537Z\"}]}},{\"result\":{\"data\":{\"active\":true,\"state\":\"starter\",\"hadPriorSubscription\":true,\"isOrgOwner\":true,\"limits\":{\"maxBrands\":3,\"maxOfferings\":10,\"canGenerate\":\"credits\",\"creativesPerAngle\":null,\"locked\":[],\"credits\":150},\"plan\":{\"slug\":\"starter\",\"label\":\"Starter\",\"creditsPerCycle\":150,\"currentPeriodEnd\":\"2026-08-22T16:50:08.915Z\",\"status\":\"active\",\"trialEndsAt\":\"2026-08-22T16:50:08.915Z\",\"isTrialing\":true,\"cancelAtPeriodEnd\":false,\"isManual\":false},\"plans\":{\"starter\":{\"slug\":\"starter\",\"label\":\"Starter\",\"credits\":150,\"usd\":49,\"maxBrands\":3,\"maxOfferings\":10},\"pro\":{\"slug\":\"pro\",\"label\":\"Pro\",\"credits\":400,\"usd\":99,\"maxBrands\":10,\"maxOfferings\":50}}}}},{\"result\":{\"data\":{\"summary\":{\"availableCredits\":138,\"allottedCredits\":150,\"usedCredits\":12,\"manualAllotted\":0,\"subscriptionAllotted\":150,\"cycleUsedCredits\":12},\"allotments\":[{\"id\":\"66d8a1e3-21e8-4d0e-af3e-1d1a60db572b\",\"creditDelta\":150,\"description\":\"Starter plan: 150 credits\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T16:50:15.279Z\"}],\"dailyUsage\":[{\"date\":\"2026-08-15\",\"credits\":12}]}}},{\"result\":{\"data\":[{\"id\":\"2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42\",\"name\":\"Essen Root Methi Khakhra\",\"status\":\"active\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42/1786814222356-0d21d0ea-ac3e-4d17-b546-801a8cb1c8f6.jpg\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T17:16:09.509Z\"},{\"id\":\"26621125-ba2c-4841-90fe-f485fe52059e\",\"name\":\"Essen Root Calcium Millet Cookies\",\"status\":\"active\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/26621125-ba2c-4841-90fe-f485fe52059e/1786812676872-7bfd0c9b-9cc8-415e-ad6f-b9227fa20ee4.jpg\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T16:50:31.171Z\"}]}},{\"result\":{\"data\":{\"unlocked\":true,\"linkToken\":\"e5d84efcb5321ded4850b2519f4a09c069def32729beeb26\",\"rewards\":[],\"linkUrl\":\"https://makelocalads.com/r/e5d84efcb5321ded4850b2519f4a09c069def32729beeb26\"}}},{\"result\":{\"data\":{\"designGuide\":\"# Brand Design Guide: Essenroot\\n\\nThis document serves as the primary visual reference for all ad creative designers. Use these guidelines to ensure that every asset—whether a social media banner, video overlay, or display ad—remains consistent with the Essenroot brand identity.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Brand Identity & Visual Vibe\\nThe Essenroot brand is built on a foundation of **modern professionalism, clarity, and trust.** The visual language is \\\"System-Modern\\\"—it leverages clean lines, generous whitespace, and a structure that feels as reliable as a high-end software interface. \\n\\n*   **The Vibe:** Efficient, accessible, structured, and trustworthy.\\n*   **Avoid:** Distressing textures, overly \\\"hand-drawn\\\" elements, or chaotic, unstructured layouts.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. Color Palette\\nOur color strategy relies on a \\\"Action Blue\\\" against a clean, neutral background. Use the primary blue for calls to action (CTAs) and the dark grays for primary messaging.\\n\\n### Primary Colors\\n*   **Action Blue (`#0d6efd`):** A vibrant, high-energy blue. This is our primary brand color. Use it for buttons, key icons, and to highlight the most important part of your message.\\n*   **Deep Onyx (`#212529`):** Our main text color. It’s a very dark gray (near-black) that feels softer and more premium than pure black.\\n*   **Pure White (`#ffffff`):** Use this as the primary background color to keep designs feeling airy and clean.\\n\\n### Secondary/Supportive Colors\\n*   **Neutral Gray (`#6c757d`):** A balanced middle-gray. Use this for secondary information or \\\"de-emphasized\\\" text.\\n*   **Soft Cloud (`#f8f9fa`):** An off-white/very light gray. Excellent for subtle section backgrounds or card containers to separate content from the white background.\\n\\n### Status Colors (Use Sparingly)\\n*   **Success Green (`#198754`):** Used for \\\"verified,\\\" \\\"complete,\\\" or \\\"growth\\\" contexts.\\n*   **Danger Red (`#dc3545`):** Reserved for \\\"urgent,\\\" \\\"limited time,\\\" or \\\"stop\\\" messaging.\\n*   **Warning Gold (`#ffc107`):** Used for attention-grabbing alerts or highlighting \\\"Gold\\\" tier features.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Typography\\nSince you may not have our specific system fonts installed, aim for a **clean, geometric sans-serif** (e.g., Roboto, Helvetica Neue, or Arial).\\n\\n*   **Style Description:** The fonts should look \\\"Neutral and Modern.\\\" They should not have serifs (the little feet on letters). They should feel like the text you see on an iPhone or a clean web application.\\n*   **Hierarchy & Weights:**\\n    *   **Headings:** Use **Medium (Weight 500)**. Headings should be significantly larger than body text (approx. 2.5x larger) to create a clear \\\"Entry Point\\\" for the eye.\\n    *   **Body Text:** Use **Regular (Weight 400)**. Ensure a line height of 1.5x the font size to keep the text breathable and easy to read.\\n    *   **Bold Elements:** Use **Bolder (Weight 700+)** only for extreme emphasis or short labels.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. UI & Layout Elements\\nWhen creating buttons or containers in your ads, follow these structural rules:\\n\\n*   **Corner Radius:** Use a **subtle rounded corner (approx. 6px / 0.375rem)**. Avoid perfectly square corners (too harsh) and fully \\\"pill-shaped\\\" buttons (too playful).\\n*   **Buttons:**\\n    *   **Primary CTA:** White text on an Action Blue (`#0d6efd`) background.\\n    *   **Secondary CTA:** Action Blue text inside a button with a 1px Blue border and a transparent background.\\n*   **Borders:** Keep lines thin (1px). Use the \\\"Soft Cloud\\\" or \\\"Neutral Gray\\\" hex codes for borders to keep them from being distracting.\\n*   **Spacing:** Follow a \\\"Gutter\\\" rule. Leave plenty of \\\"negative space\\\" around your text and logos. Do not crowd the edges of the ad frame.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. Imagery & Photography\\n*   **Style:** Clear, high-definition, and well-lit. \\n*   **Composition:** Images should have a clear focal point. If placing text over an image, use a subtle dark overlay or ensure the text sits in a \\\"clean\\\" area of the photo to maintain legibility.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Note to Designers\\nThis document is a **guide**, not a rigid template. Your goal is to capture the *spirit* of Essenroot while optimizing for the specific ad platform you are designing for.\\n\\n*   **Context over Rules:** If this guide mentions a specific button style, but your ad direction is an \\\"Editorial Style\\\" long-form image, adapt the colors to that context rather than forcing a web-style button where it doesn't belong.\\n*   **Don't use everything at once:** You don't need to use all the status colors (Green, Red, Gold) in one ad. Stick to the Primary Blue and Onyx for 90% of your work.\\n*   **Legibility First:** If a brand color makes text hard to read over a specific background, prioritize legibility by adjusting the weight or choosing a higher-contrast color from our palette.\",\"sourceJobId\":\"2663a276-57cb-4818-a78c-a406efc0f353\",\"referenceAdDesignImages\":[]}}},{\"result\":{\"data\":{\"unreadCount\":0,\"preferences\":{\"emailEnabled\":true},\"items\":[{\"id\":\"d58cf93b-4958-4126-8ac4-7a1d36dbd0c9\",\"type\":\"design_guide_ready\",\"title\":\"EssenRoots is ready\",\"body\":\"Your brand is created and its design guide is set up. Review it, append your own suggestions, or remove anything that doesn't fit.\",\"href\":\"/app/guide?brandId=32fa1d3d-9b2a-43e0-a393-7a3e95511f54\",\"severity\":\"success\",\"metadata\":{\"brandId\":\"32fa1d3d-9b2a-43e0-a393-7a3e95511f54\",\"jobStatus\":\"completed\",\"urlSnapshotJobId\":\"2663a276-57cb-4818-a78c-a406efc0f353\"},\"readAt\":\"2026-08-15T17:04:15.339Z\",\"emailedAt\":null,\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T16:49:01.706Z\"}]}}},{\"result\":{\"data\":{\"entries\":[],\"latestSeq\":0}}},{\"result\":{\"data\":[{\"id\":\"2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42\",\"orgId\":\"62f84ee9-c45f-4e41-8868-bcf0bb1ec033\",\"brandId\":\"32fa1d3d-9b2a-43e0-a393-7a3e95511f54\",\"parentOfferingId\":null,\"offeringType\":\"product\",\"kind\":\"physical\",\"name\":\"Essen Root Methi Khakhra\",\"slug\":\"untitled-product-2\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://essenroot.com/product/khakhra/methi\",\"status\":\"active\",\"ingestionTriggerRunId\":\"run_06g0cr45bnjr6seeu9t56tnu01\",\"imageIngestionStatus\":\"ready\",\"visualDescriptionStatus\":\"ready\",\"visualDescriptionTriggerRunId\":\"run_06g0crd4p21qp0nu9n6si8l301\",\"visualDescriptionImageFingerprint\":\"pawrav\",\"variantKey\":null,\"variantAttributes\":{},\"position\":0,\"productTruth\":{\"brand\":\"Essen Root\",\"price\":\"INR 80.00\",\"images\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42/1786814222356-0d21d0ea-ac3e-4d17-b546-801a8cb1c8f6.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42/1786814222056-2fffcf0a-4d23-4885-8aef-a9706ccb3d71.jpg\"],\"discount\":\"20% OFF\",\"netWeight\":\"120g\",\"shelfLife\":\"6 Months\",\"description\":\"A wholesome multigrain snack made with Bajra, Foxtail, Finger millet, Jowar, and Rajgeera flour blended with wheat, methi, and sunflower oil. Rich in protein, fibre, and essential minerals, it delivers a crunchy and nutritious bite. With no preservatives or artificial colours, this millet-based treat combines traditional goodness with modern nutrition for guilt-free snacking.\",\"hasNSFWRisk\":false,\"ingredients\":[\"Wheat flour (52.55%)\",\"Bajara (Pearl millet) flour (4.50%)\",\"Ragi flour (3.00%)\",\"Barnyard flour (3.00%)\",\"Jowar (Sorghum) flour (3.00%)\",\"Rajgira flour (10.51%)\",\"Red Chilli Powder (0.90%)\",\"Salt (2.25%)\",\"Oil (15.02%)\",\"Methi leaves (5.26%)\"],\"taxonomyTag\":\"product:food:snack\",\"originalPrice\":\"INR 100.00\",\"variantSummary\":{\"count\":1,\"attributes\":{\"brand\":[\"Essen Root\"],\"discount\":[\"20% OFF\"],\"netWeight\":[\"120g\"],\"shelfLife\":[\"6 Months\"],\"variantKey\":[\"120g Pack\"],\"description\":[\"A wholesome multigrain snack made with Bajra, Foxtail, Finger millet, Jowar, and Rajgeera flour blended with wheat, methi, and sunflower oil. Rich in protein, fibre, and essential minerals, it delivers a crunchy and nutritious bite. With no preservatives or artificial colours, this millet-based treat combines traditional goodness with modern nutrition for guilt-free snacking.\"],\"hasNSFWRisk\":[\"false\"],\"taxonomyTag\":[\"product:food:snack\"],\"variantLabel\":[\"120g Pack\"],\"originalPrice\":[\"INR 100.00\"],\"perProductWeight\":[\"30g\"]}},\"perProductWeight\":\"30g\",\"buying_archetypes\":{\"primaryArchetype\":{\"name\":\"Upgrade / Optimization\",\"reason\":\"This millet-based, preservative-free khakhra represents a healthier, nutrient-dense upgrade over standard refined-flour snacks for health-conscious consumers looking to optimize their nutrition.\"},\"secondaryArchetypes\":[{\"name\":\"Routine / Replenishment\",\"reason\":\"Khakhra is a staple daily tea-time companion in Indian households, making this product a regular pantry replenishment item for healthy snacking habits.\"},{\"name\":\"Values / Belief\",\"reason\":\"The product aligns with the consumer's clean-eating values and health beliefs by utilizing ancient grains like millets and avoiding artificial preservatives.\"}]},\"visual_description\":\"The product is a roasted methi khakhra, a thin Indian flatbread cracker, packaged in a matte-finish, light olive-khaki stand-up pouch. The actual crackers, as seen unpacked, are ultra-thin, flat, and rectangular with rounded corners, featuring a crisp, matte, and slightly bubbled texture; they have a warm, toasted golden-yellow to deep ochre-orange hue, speckled with fine, dark green dried fenugreek leaf flecks and occasional small, charred brown spots. The heat-sealed, zip-lock pouch features dual tear notches at the top. Its front panel displays bold, dark brown, sans-serif branding that reads \\\"ROASTED METHI KHAKHRA\\\" above \\\"CRISPY & NUTRITIOUS FLATREADS\\\" on the left, alongside three functional icon callouts (\\\"HIGH FIBRE\\\", \\\"READY TO EAT\\\", \\\"SUPERGRAIN POWER\\\") and a cartoon illustration of a smiling young girl with brown pigtails in an orange shirt eating a cracker. To the right of the text is a circular graphic containing fan-sliced wedges of a round, herb-speckled khakhra, which contrasts with the rectangular shape of the actual loose crackers. A dark brown horizontal banner at the bottom reads \\\"MADE WITH REAL FENUGREEK LEAVES\\\" next to a circular \\\"Net Wt. 130g\\\" badge. The back of the pouch organizes detailed nutritional and ingredient tables on the upper half, manufacturer details and a circular icon graphic in the middle, and a dedicated white block at the bottom containing a QR code, barcode, and product specifications including a printed net weight of 120g.\",\"nutritionalInformationPer50g\":[\"Energy: 204.5 kcal\",\"Carbohydrates: 28.35 g\",\"Total sugar: 0.35 g\",\"Protein: 5.16 g\",\"Total fat: 8.84 g\",\"Dietary Fiber: 4.4 g\",\"Iron: 2.25 mg\",\"Calcium: 32.5 mg\",\"Sodium: 445 mg\"]},\"normalizedSummary\":{\"summary\":\"A wholesome, crunchy multigrain snack made with five types of millets, wheat, and fresh fenugreek (methi) leaves, rich in protein and fiber with no preservatives.\"},\"createdBy\":\"f5dfb377-dac7-46a6-aea3-a4e04cb45e54\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T17:16:09.509Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-15T17:17:46.994Z\",\"variantCount\":1,\"creativeCount\":3,\"generatedCreativeCount\":3,\"hasGeneratedCreatives\":true},{\"id\":\"26621125-ba2c-4841-90fe-f485fe52059e\",\"orgId\":\"62f84ee9-c45f-4e41-8868-bcf0bb1ec033\",\"brandId\":\"32fa1d3d-9b2a-43e0-a393-7a3e95511f54\",\"parentOfferingId\":null,\"offeringType\":\"product\",\"kind\":\"physical\",\"name\":\"Essen Root Calcium Millet Cookies\",\"slug\":\"untitled-product\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://essenroot.com/product/khakhra/calcium-rich\",\"status\":\"active\",\"ingestionTriggerRunId\":\"run_06g0cl8cbnnbt0snj7dromdh01\",\"imageIngestionStatus\":\"ready\",\"visualDescriptionStatus\":\"ready\",\"visualDescriptionTriggerRunId\":\"run_06g0cljj8kgtfv8auetnilgd01\",\"visualDescriptionImageFingerprint\":\"1vm4ndd\",\"variantKey\":null,\"variantAttributes\":{},\"position\":0,\"productTruth\":{\"brand\":\"Essen Root\",\"price\":\"INR 99.00\",\"images\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/26621125-ba2c-4841-90fe-f485fe52059e/1786812676872-7bfd0c9b-9cc8-415e-ad6f-b9227fa20ee4.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/26621125-ba2c-4841-90fe-f485fe52059e/1786812677088-4f002e47-5393-4a3c-9b64-9534d0a28066.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/26621125-ba2c-4841-90fe-f485fe52059e/1786812676426-d77b0e6f-a5e2-40a6-8252-99a1a4d8b9c6.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/26621125-ba2c-4841-90fe-f485fe52059e/1786812676428-bd6f72d4-c207-4d90-b73c-c13fc654f533.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/26621125-ba2c-4841-90fe-f485fe52059e/1786812676416-2ed08a22-c1f7-4f7b-a14a-b7841877cd77.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/26621125-ba2c-4841-90fe-f485fe52059e/1786812676598-13dbf0e0-a575-4fd6-8e63-451441d548b1.jpg\"],\"netWeight\":\"100g\",\"shelfLife\":\"6 Months\",\"hasNSFWRisk\":false,\"ingredients\":[\"Ragi flour (17.47%)\",\"Jowar flour (26.2%)\",\"Butter (21.83%)\",\"Cream (4.37%)\",\"Organic Jaggery (21.38%)\",\"Milk powder (2.18%)\",\"Cashew (1.75%)\",\"Almond powder (0.87%)\",\"Baking powder (1.31%)\",\"Chocolate powder (1.75%)\",\"Vanilla essence (0.44%)\"],\"taxonomyTag\":\"product:food:cookies\",\"originalPrice\":\"INR 120.00\",\"variantSummary\":{\"count\":1,\"attributes\":{\"brand\":[\"Essen Root\"],\"netWeight\":[\"100g\"],\"shelfLife\":[\"6 Months\"],\"variantKey\":[\"100g Pack\"],\"hasNSFWRisk\":[\"false\"],\"taxonomyTag\":[\"product:food:cookies\"],\"variantLabel\":[\"100g Pack\"],\"originalPrice\":[\"INR 120.00\"],\"perProductWeight\":[\"10g\"],\"discountPercentage\":[\"18%\"],\"nutritionalInformationPer100g\":[\"Carbohydrates: 55.1g, Total sugar: 16.2g, Protein: 6.99g, Total fat: 22.52g, Saturated fat: 13.09g, Trans fat: 0.69g, Dietary Fiber: 5.4g, Iron: 4.3mg, Calcium: 153mg, Zinc: 1.8mg\"]}},\"perProductWeight\":\"10g\",\"buying_archetypes\":{\"primaryArchetype\":{\"name\":\"Upgrade / Optimization\",\"reason\":\"This product acts as a direct, nutrient-dense upgrade to standard, highly processed tea-time cookies by replacing refined flour and sugar with healthy millets, butter, and organic jaggery.\"},\"secondaryArchetypes\":[{\"name\":\"Values / Belief\",\"reason\":\"It appeals directly to health-conscious consumers who prioritize clean eating, wholesome traditional ingredients like Ragi and Jowar, and avoiding refined additives.\"},{\"name\":\"Routine / Replenishment\",\"reason\":\"Cookies are a staple of daily snacking and tea-time habits, making this a healthy alternative designed for regular, recurring consumption.\"}]},\"discountPercentage\":\"18%\",\"visual_description\":\"This product consists of circular, medium-brown baked cookies with a matte, finely granulated texture, characterized by a prominent spiral rosette pattern of raised ridges radiating outward from the center to form a scalloped perimeter. The cookies are packaged in a rectangular paperboard box with a dominant deep teal-blue background. The front panel prominently displays the words \\\"CALCIUM COOKIES\\\" in bold, white, capital letters beneath a circular \\\"ESSENROOT\\\" logo that features a brown woven basket filled with grains and green leaves. To the right of the text, a graphic displays a vertical stack of four of the chocolate-colored swirl cookies resting against a stylized yellow and grey curved backdrop. Along the bottom of the front panel, a series of small, circular white informational icons are printed—variously emphasizing health claims like high calcium, no palm oil, and no preservatives depending on the print run—alongside a \\\"Net Wt. 100 g\\\" label and a piece count indicator that reads either 10 or 14 cookies. The side panels feature the circular basket logo centered within a cream-colored oval, while the top panel is detailed with white text columns for ingredients and nutrition facts, alongside a small cartoon illustration of a child next to labeled graphic elements representing ingredients like jaggery and ragi.\",\"nutritionalInformationPer100g\":\"Carbohydrates: 55.1g, Total sugar: 16.2g, Protein: 6.99g, Total fat: 22.52g, Saturated fat: 13.09g, Trans fat: 0.69g, Dietary Fiber: 5.4g, Iron: 4.3mg, Calcium: 153mg, Zinc: 1.8mg\"},\"normalizedSummary\":{\"summary\":\"Wholesome and nutrient-dense millet cookies crafted with Ragi, Jowar, butter, and organic jaggery, offering a rich source of calcium, iron, and zinc.\"},\"createdBy\":\"f5dfb377-dac7-46a6-aea3-a4e04cb45e54\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T16:50:31.171Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-15T16:52:28.908Z\",\"variantCount\":1,\"creativeCount\":3,\"generatedCreativeCount\":3,\"hasGeneratedCreatives\":true}]}},{\"result\":{\"data\":{\"id\":\"2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42\",\"orgId\":\"62f84ee9-c45f-4e41-8868-bcf0bb1ec033\",\"brandId\":\"32fa1d3d-9b2a-43e0-a393-7a3e95511f54\",\"parentOfferingId\":null,\"offeringType\":\"product\",\"kind\":\"physical\",\"name\":\"Essen Root Methi Khakhra\",\"slug\":\"untitled-product-2\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://essenroot.com/product/khakhra/methi\",\"status\":\"active\",\"ingestionTriggerRunId\":\"run_06g0cr45bnjr6seeu9t56tnu01\",\"imageIngestionStatus\":\"ready\",\"visualDescriptionStatus\":\"ready\",\"visualDescriptionTriggerRunId\":\"run_06g0crd4p21qp0nu9n6si8l301\",\"visualDescriptionImageFingerprint\":\"pawrav\",\"variantKey\":null,\"variantAttributes\":{},\"position\":0,\"productTruth\":{\"brand\":\"Essen Root\",\"price\":\"INR 80.00\",\"images\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42/1786814222356-0d21d0ea-ac3e-4d17-b546-801a8cb1c8f6.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42/1786814222056-2fffcf0a-4d23-4885-8aef-a9706ccb3d71.jpg\"],\"discount\":\"20% OFF\",\"netWeight\":\"120g\",\"shelfLife\":\"6 Months\",\"description\":\"A wholesome multigrain snack made with Bajra, Foxtail, Finger millet, Jowar, and Rajgeera flour blended with wheat, methi, and sunflower oil. Rich in protein, fibre, and essential minerals, it delivers a crunchy and nutritious bite. With no preservatives or artificial colours, this millet-based treat combines traditional goodness with modern nutrition for guilt-free snacking.\",\"hasNSFWRisk\":false,\"ingredients\":[\"Wheat flour (52.55%)\",\"Bajara (Pearl millet) flour (4.50%)\",\"Ragi flour (3.00%)\",\"Barnyard flour (3.00%)\",\"Jowar (Sorghum) flour (3.00%)\",\"Rajgira flour (10.51%)\",\"Red Chilli Powder (0.90%)\",\"Salt (2.25%)\",\"Oil (15.02%)\",\"Methi leaves (5.26%)\"],\"taxonomyTag\":\"product:food:snack\",\"originalPrice\":\"INR 100.00\",\"variantSummary\":{\"count\":1,\"attributes\":{\"brand\":[\"Essen Root\"],\"discount\":[\"20% OFF\"],\"netWeight\":[\"120g\"],\"shelfLife\":[\"6 Months\"],\"variantKey\":[\"120g Pack\"],\"description\":[\"A wholesome multigrain snack made with Bajra, Foxtail, Finger millet, Jowar, and Rajgeera flour blended with wheat, methi, and sunflower oil. Rich in protein, fibre, and essential minerals, it delivers a crunchy and nutritious bite. With no preservatives or artificial colours, this millet-based treat combines traditional goodness with modern nutrition for guilt-free snacking.\"],\"hasNSFWRisk\":[\"false\"],\"taxonomyTag\":[\"product:food:snack\"],\"variantLabel\":[\"120g Pack\"],\"originalPrice\":[\"INR 100.00\"],\"perProductWeight\":[\"30g\"]}},\"perProductWeight\":\"30g\",\"buying_archetypes\":{\"primaryArchetype\":{\"name\":\"Upgrade / Optimization\",\"reason\":\"This millet-based, preservative-free khakhra represents a healthier, nutrient-dense upgrade over standard refined-flour snacks for health-conscious consumers looking to optimize their nutrition.\"},\"secondaryArchetypes\":[{\"name\":\"Routine / Replenishment\",\"reason\":\"Khakhra is a staple daily tea-time companion in Indian households, making this product a regular pantry replenishment item for healthy snacking habits.\"},{\"name\":\"Values / Belief\",\"reason\":\"The product aligns with the consumer's clean-eating values and health beliefs by utilizing ancient grains like millets and avoiding artificial preservatives.\"}]},\"visual_description\":\"The product is a roasted methi khakhra, a thin Indian flatbread cracker, packaged in a matte-finish, light olive-khaki stand-up pouch. The actual crackers, as seen unpacked, are ultra-thin, flat, and rectangular with rounded corners, featuring a crisp, matte, and slightly bubbled texture; they have a warm, toasted golden-yellow to deep ochre-orange hue, speckled with fine, dark green dried fenugreek leaf flecks and occasional small, charred brown spots. The heat-sealed, zip-lock pouch features dual tear notches at the top. Its front panel displays bold, dark brown, sans-serif branding that reads \\\"ROASTED METHI KHAKHRA\\\" above \\\"CRISPY & NUTRITIOUS FLATREADS\\\" on the left, alongside three functional icon callouts (\\\"HIGH FIBRE\\\", \\\"READY TO EAT\\\", \\\"SUPERGRAIN POWER\\\") and a cartoon illustration of a smiling young girl with brown pigtails in an orange shirt eating a cracker. To the right of the text is a circular graphic containing fan-sliced wedges of a round, herb-speckled khakhra, which contrasts with the rectangular shape of the actual loose crackers. A dark brown horizontal banner at the bottom reads \\\"MADE WITH REAL FENUGREEK LEAVES\\\" next to a circular \\\"Net Wt. 130g\\\" badge. The back of the pouch organizes detailed nutritional and ingredient tables on the upper half, manufacturer details and a circular icon graphic in the middle, and a dedicated white block at the bottom containing a QR code, barcode, and product specifications including a printed net weight of 120g.\",\"nutritionalInformationPer50g\":[\"Energy: 204.5 kcal\",\"Carbohydrates: 28.35 g\",\"Total sugar: 0.35 g\",\"Protein: 5.16 g\",\"Total fat: 8.84 g\",\"Dietary Fiber: 4.4 g\",\"Iron: 2.25 mg\",\"Calcium: 32.5 mg\",\"Sodium: 445 mg\"]},\"normalizedSummary\":{\"summary\":\"A wholesome, crunchy multigrain snack made with five types of millets, wheat, and fresh fenugreek (methi) leaves, rich in protein and fiber with no preservatives.\"},\"createdBy\":\"f5dfb377-dac7-46a6-aea3-a4e04cb45e54\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T17:16:09.509Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-15T17:17:46.994Z\",\"parentOffering\":null,\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"a5192acd-8b83-4bfe-85cd-3edb31b48720\",\"orgId\":\"62f84ee9-c45f-4e41-8868-bcf0bb1ec033\",\"brandId\":\"32fa1d3d-9b2a-43e0-a393-7a3e95511f54\",\"parentOfferingId\":\"2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42\",\"offeringType\":\"variant\",\"kind\":\"physical\",\"name\":\"Essen Root Methi Khakhra - 120g Pack\",\"slug\":\"untitled-product-2-brand-essen-root-description-a-wholesome-multigrain-snack-made-with-bajra-foxtail-finger-millet-jowar-and-rajgeera-flour-blended-with-wheat-methi-and-sunflower-oil-rich-in-protein-fibre-and-essential-minerals-it-delivers-a-crunchy-and-nutritious-bite-with-no-preservatives-or-artificial-colo