\":\"120g\",\"shelfLife\":\"6 Months\",\"variantKey\":\"120g Pack\",\"description\":\"A wholesome multigrain snack made with Bajra, Foxtail, Finger millet, Jowar, and Rajgeera flour blended with wheat, methi, and sunflower oil. Rich in protein, fibre, and essential minerals, it delivers a crunchy and nutritious bite. With no preservatives or artificial colours, this millet-based treat combines traditional goodness with modern nutrition for guilt-free snacking.\",\"hasNSFWRisk\":\"false\",\"taxonomyTag\":\"product:food:snack\",\"variantLabel\":\"120g Pack\",\"originalPrice\":\"INR 100.00\",\"perProductWeight\":\"30g\"},\"nutritionalInformationPer50g\":[\"Energy: 204.5 kcal\",\"Carbohydrates: 28.35 g\",\"Total sugar: 0.35 g\",\"Protein: 5.16 g\",\"Total fat: 8.84 g\",\"Dietary Fiber: 4.4 g\",\"Iron: 2.25 mg\",\"Calcium: 32.5 mg\",\"Sodium: 445 mg\"]},\"normalizedSummary\":{},\"createdBy\":\"f5dfb377-dac7-46a6-aea3-a4e04cb45e54\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T17:17:23.575Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-15T17:17:47.053Z\"}],\"isVariant\":false,\"variantCount\":1,\"generatedCreativeCount\":3,\"hasGeneratedCreatives\":true}}},{\"result\":{\"data\":{\"campaigns\":[{\"id\":\"065d84eb-bf03-47bf-87d5-85e86dcb67d6\",\"name\":\"Get discovered campaign\",\"description\":\"\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-15T17:19:51.122Z\",\"requestedCount\":3,\"creativeCount\":3,\"generationStatus\":\"completed\",\"previews\":[{\"id\":\"b3ec3cc1-2474-4f03-b759-129c68a84e18\",\"imageUrl\":\"/api/creative-assets/b3ec3cc1-2474-4f03-b759-129c68a84e18?versionId=9ff1c813-a366-4106-b7b4-895221482391\",\"alt\":\"Get discovered campaign\"},{\"id\":\"2b13d871-885f-453e-ac52-0e6d5d8295ca\",\"imageUrl\":\"/api/creative-assets/2b13d871-885f-453e-ac52-0e6d5d8295ca?versionId=07d6ab55-ca72-4f4a-b429-4d4768adbfa2\",\"alt\":\"Get discovered campaign\"},{\"id\":\"b128a159-95be-44ba-ac60-ea0fc15967f2\",\"imageUrl\":\"/api/creative-assets/b128a159-95be-44ba-ac60-ea0fc15967f2?versionId=f0509c54-c0e0-4b4b-b36d-069f9a331d3e\",\"alt\":\"Get discovered campaign\"}]}]}}},{\"result\":{\"data\":{\"id\":\"065d84eb-bf03-47bf-87d5-85e86dcb67d6\",\"offeringId\":\"2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42\",\"name\":\"Get discovered campaign\",\"description\":\"\",\"generationStatus\":\"completed\",\"requestedCount\":3,\"activeGenerationJobIds\":[],\"creatives\":[{\"id\":\"b3ec3cc1-2474-4f03-b759-129c68a84e18\",\"status\":\"generated\",\"imageUrl\":\"/api/creative-assets/b3ec3cc1-2474-4f03-b759-129c68a84e18?versionId=9ff1c813-a366-4106-b7b4-895221482391\"},{\"id\":\"2b13d871-885f-453e-ac52-0e6d5d8295ca\",\"status\":\"generated\",\"imageUrl\":\"/api/creative-assets/2b13d871-885f-453e-ac52-0e6d5d8295ca?versionId=07d6ab55-ca72-4f4a-b429-4d4768adbfa2\"},{\"id\":\"b128a159-95be-44ba-ac60-ea0fc15967f2\",\"status\":\"generated\",\"imageUrl\":\"/api/creative-assets/b128a159-95be-44ba-ac60-ea0fc15967f2?versionId=f0509c54-c0e0-4b4b-b36d-069f9a331d3e\"}]}}},{\"result\":{\"data\":{\"items\":[{\"id\":\"b3ec3cc1-2474-4f03-b759-129c68a84e18\",\"orgId\":\"62f84ee9-c45f-4e41-8868-bcf0bb1ec033\",\"offeringId\":\"2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42\",\"strategyRunId\":null,\"generationJobId\":\"c0ad420a-cbe6-43fd-9422-469341798623\",\"triggerRunId\":null,\"audienceNodeId\":null,\"angleNodeId\":null,\"campaignId\":\"065d84eb-bf03-47bf-87d5-85e86dcb67d6\",\"adAudienceId\":\"d92add18-d836-4eca-949f-ccbf7d7f2a1a\",\"campaignAngleId\":null,\"promptRecipeId\":null,\"currentVersionId\":\"9ff1c813-a366-4106-b7b4-895221482391\",\"storageKey\":\"campaign-creatives/065d84eb-bf03-47bf-87d5-85e86dcb67d6/4a48fa60-f9a4-4693-9880-31894dc45bde.png\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/campaign-creatives/065d84eb-bf03-47bf-87d5-85e86dcb67d6/4a48fa60-f9a4-4693-9880-31894dc45bde.png\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/campaign-creatives/065d84eb-bf03-47bf-87d5-85e86dcb67d6/4a48fa60-f9a4-4693-9880-31894dc45bde.png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"width\":1024,\"height\":1024,\"finalImagePrompt\":null,\"status\":\"generated\",\"downloadCount\":0,\"metadata\":{\"brief\":\"Using the Problem-Agitate-Solve (PAS) framework, this concept targets the daily routine friction of mothers finding half-eaten, soggy food returned in school lunchboxes. The visual is a warm, high-definition, in-context lifestyle photo of a modern, organized kitchen counter. An open, stainless steel tiffin box is the hero, featuring a compartment packed with crisp, intact, rectangular golden-yellow khakhra crackers, arranged alongside fresh baby carrots and cucumber slices, with the clean Essen Root olive-khaki pouch sitting elegantly in the soft-focus background. The visual hero is the perfect, mess-free tiffin-box solution that kids love. The short on-image headline is 'No more empty school tiffin boxes.' The soft call to action is 'See how it works' styled inside a minimalist Action Blue (#0d6efd) bordered button with 6px rounded corners. To stay on-brand, keep the scene brightly lit with natural light, use clean geometric sans-serif typography, and ensure the background elements remain uncluttered and structured.\",\"prompt\":\"Instructions by the director: Using the Problem-Agitate-Solve (PAS) framework, this concept targets the daily routine friction of mothers finding half-eaten, soggy food returned in school lunchboxes. The visual is a warm, high-definition, in-context lifestyle photo of a modern, organized kitchen counter. An open, stainless steel tiffin box is the hero, featuring a compartment packed with crisp, intact, rectangular golden-yellow khakhra crackers, arranged alongside fresh baby carrots and cucumber slices, with the clean Essen Root olive-khaki pouch sitting elegantly in the soft-focus background. The visual hero is the perfect, mess-free tiffin-box solution that kids love. The short on-image headline is 'No more empty school tiffin boxes.' The soft call to action is 'See how it works' styled inside a minimalist Action Blue (#0d6efd) bordered button with 6px rounded corners. To stay on-brand, keep the scene brightly lit with natural light, use clean geometric sans-serif typography, and ensure the background elements remain uncluttered and structured.\\n\\nProduct appearance: The product is a roasted methi khakhra, a thin Indian flatbread cracker, packaged in a matte-finish, light olive-khaki stand-up pouch. The actual crackers, as seen unpacked, are ultra-thin, flat, and rectangular with rounded corners, featuring a crisp, matte, and slightly bubbled texture; they have a warm, toasted golden-yellow to deep ochre-orange hue, speckled with fine, dark green dried fenugreek leaf flecks and occasional small, charred brown spots. The heat-sealed, zip-lock pouch features dual tear notches at the top. Its front panel displays bold, dark brown, sans-serif branding that reads \\\"ROASTED METHI KHAKHRA\\\" above \\\"CRISPY & NUTRITIOUS FLATREADS\\\" on the left, alongside three functional icon callouts (\\\"HIGH FIBRE\\\", \\\"READY TO EAT\\\", \\\"SUPERGRAIN POWER\\\") and a cartoon illustration of a smiling young girl with brown pigtails in an orange shirt eating a cracker. To the right of the text is a circular graphic containing fan-sliced wedges of a round, herb-speckled khakhra, which contrasts with the rectangular shape of the actual loose crackers. A dark brown horizontal banner at the bottom reads \\\"MADE WITH REAL FENUGREEK LEAVES\\\" next to a circular \\\"Net Wt. 130g\\\" badge. The back of the pouch organizes detailed nutritional and ingredient tables on the upper half, manufacturer details and a circular icon graphic in the middle, and a dedicated white block at the bottom containing a QR code, barcode, and product specifications including a printed net weight of 120g.\\n\\nUse the product appearance text only as a private visual reference for accurately drawing the product. Do not print, quote, paraphrase, label, or turn any of that description into ad copy. Treat orientation-specific details carefully: show front-only details only when the product front is visible; if the brief shows the back, side, top, or an angled view where those details would not be visible, omit them instead of moving them onto the wrong face.\\n\\nThe attached product photos show the real product — reproduce it faithfully.\\n\\nThe final attached image is the official brand logo. Add it once, subtly, in clean negative space; keep it exact, legible, and uncropped.\\n\\nDesign requirements (apply to this ad):\\n- Follow the instructions by the director.\\n- Make the ad design, layout, typography on-branded, but should look premium, editorial-like.\\n- Establish a clear visual hierarchy: one dominant focal point the eye lands on\\n  first, then the supporting message, then the CTA.\\n- Keep strong figure/ground contrast. If text sits over imagery, place a scrim or\\n  overlay behind it so it stays fully legible.\\n- Place the focal subject on a rule-of-thirds line; leave generous whitespace and\\n  avoid clutter.\\n- Use a limited palette anchored to the brand colors (~60-30-10), reserving one\\n  accent color for the call to action.\\n- Keep 20% space all around the creative for the ad to look cleaner\\n- Group and align elements cleanly (Gestalt); use at most two type styles.\",\"source\":\"campaign-creatives\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/campaign-creatives/065d84eb-bf03-47bf-87d5-85e86dcb67d6/4a48fa60-f9a4-4693-9880-31894dc45bde.png\",\"language\":\"English\",\"lastError\":null,\"hasNSFWRisk\":false,\"brandLogoUrl\":\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/brand-logos/32fa1d3d-9b2a-43e0-a393-7a3e95511f54/569c1fa7-5d60-407d-b6a6-33020620ec35.png\",\"imageProvider\":\"openai\",\"imageGeneratorId\":\"openai/gpt-image-2\",\"productImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42/1786814222356-0d21d0ea-ac3e-4d17-b546-801a8cb1c8f6.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42/1786814222056-2fffcf0a-4d23-4885-8aef-a9706ccb3d71.jpg\"],\"providerRequestId\":\"cc399eec-4fd8-44f5-98a0-a20c88252d25\",\"visualDescription\":\"The product is a roasted methi khakhra, a thin Indian flatbread cracker, packaged in a matte-finish, light olive-khaki stand-up pouch. The actual crackers, as seen unpacked, are ultra-thin, flat, and rectangular with rounded corners, featuring a crisp, matte, and slightly bubbled texture; they have a warm, toasted golden-yellow to deep ochre-orange hue, speckled with fine, dark green dried fenugreek leaf flecks and occasional small, charred brown spots. The heat-sealed, zip-lock pouch features dual tear notches at the top. Its front panel displays bold, dark brown, sans-serif branding that reads \\\"ROASTED METHI KHAKHRA\\\" above \\\"CRISPY & NUTRITIOUS FLATREADS\\\" on the left, alongside three functional icon callouts (\\\"HIGH FIBRE\\\", \\\"READY TO EAT\\\", \\\"SUPERGRAIN POWER\\\") and a cartoon illustration of a smiling young girl with brown pigtails in an orange shirt eating a cracker. To the right of the text is a circular graphic containing fan-sliced wedges of a round, herb-speckled khakhra, which contrasts with the rectangular shape of the actual loose crackers. A dark brown horizontal banner at the bottom reads \\\"MADE WITH REAL FENUGREEK LEAVES\\\" next to a circular \\\"Net Wt. 130g\\\" badge. The back of the pouch organizes detailed nutritional and ingredient tables on the upper half, manufacturer details and a circular icon graphic in the middle, and a dedicated white block at the bottom containing a QR code, barcode, and product specifications including a printed net weight of 120g.\",\"moderationFallback\":null,\"referenceImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42/1786814222356-0d21d0ea-ac3e-4d17-b546-801a8cb1c8f6.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42/1786814222056-2fffcf0a-4d23-4885-8aef-a9706ccb3d71.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/brand-logos/32fa1d3d-9b2a-43e0-a393-7a3e95511f54/569c1fa7-5d60-407d-b6a6-33020620ec35.png\"],\"referenceAdImageUrls\":[],\"originalReferenceImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42/1786814222356-0d21d0ea-ac3e-4d17-b546-801a8cb1c8f6.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42/1786814222056-2fffcf0a-4d23-4885-8aef-a9706ccb3d71.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/brand-logos/32fa1d3d-9b2a-43e0-a393-7a3e95511f54/569c1fa7-5d60-407d-b6a6-33020620ec35.png\"],\"normalizedReferenceImageUrls\":[],\"usedNormalizedReferenceImages\":false},\"performanceLabels\":{},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T17:18:18.741Z\",\"versions\":[{\"id\":\"9ff1c813-a366-4106-b7b4-895221482391\",\"creativeId\":\"b3ec3cc1-2474-4f03-b759-129c68a84e18\",\"versionNumber\":1,\"parentVersionId\":null,\"generationJobId\":\"c0ad420a-cbe6-43fd-9422-469341798623\",\"triggerRunId\":null,\"changeType\":\"initial\",\"instructions\":null,\"finalImagePrompt\":\"Instructions by the director: Using the Problem-Agitate-Solve (PAS) framework, this concept targets the daily routine friction of mothers finding half-eaten, soggy food returned in school lunchboxes. The visual is a warm, high-definition, in-context lifestyle photo of a modern, organized kitchen counter. An open, stainless steel tiffin box is the hero, featuring a compartment packed with crisp, intact, rectangular golden-yellow khakhra crackers, arranged alongside fresh baby carrots and cucumber slices, with the clean Essen Root olive-khaki pouch sitting elegantly in the soft-focus background. The visual hero is the perfect, mess-free tiffin-box solution that kids love. The short on-image headline is 'No more empty school tiffin boxes.' The soft call to action is 'See how it works' styled inside a minimalist Action Blue (#0d6efd) bordered button with 6px rounded corners. To stay on-brand, keep the scene brightly lit with natural light, use clean geometric sans-serif typography, and ensure the background elements remain uncluttered and structured.\\n\\nProduct appearance: The product is a roasted methi khakhra, a thin Indian flatbread cracker, packaged in a matte-finish, light olive-khaki stand-up pouch. The actual crackers, as seen unpacked, are ultra-thin, flat, and rectangular with rounded corners, featuring a crisp, matte, and slightly bubbled texture; they have a warm, toasted golden-yellow to deep ochre-orange hue, speckled with fine, dark green dried fenugreek leaf flecks and occasional small, charred brown spots. The heat-sealed, zip-lock pouch features dual tear notches at the top. Its front panel displays bold, dark brown, sans-serif branding that reads \\\"ROASTED METHI KHAKHRA\\\" above \\\"CRISPY & NUTRITIOUS FLATREADS\\\" on the left, alongside three functional icon callouts (\\\"HIGH FIBRE\\\", \\\"READY TO EAT\\\", \\\"SUPERGRAIN POWER\\\") and a cartoon illustration of a smiling young girl with brown pigtails in an orange shirt eating a cracker. To the right of the text is a circular graphic containing fan-sliced wedges of a round, herb-speckled khakhra, which contrasts with the rectangular shape of the actual loose crackers. A dark brown horizontal banner at the bottom reads \\\"MADE WITH REAL FENUGREEK LEAVES\\\" next to a circular \\\"Net Wt. 130g\\\" badge. The back of the pouch organizes detailed nutritional and ingredient tables on the upper half, manufacturer details and a circular icon graphic in the middle, and a dedicated white block at the bottom containing a QR code, barcode, and product specifications including a printed net weight of 120g.\\n\\nUse the product appearance text only as a private visual reference for accurately drawing the product. Do not print, quote, paraphrase, label, or turn any of that description into ad copy. Treat orientation-specific details carefully: show front-only details only when the product front is visible; if the brief shows the back, side, top, or an angled view where those details would not be visible, omit them instead of moving them onto the wrong face.\\n\\nThe attached product photos show the real product — reproduce it faithfully.\\n\\nThe final attached image is the official brand logo. Add it once, subtly, in clean negative space; keep it exact, legible, and uncropped.\\n\\nDesign requirements (apply to this ad):\\n- Follow the instructions by the director.\\n- Make the ad design, layout, typography on-branded, but should look premium, editorial-like.\\n- Establish a clear visual hierarchy: one dominant focal point the eye lands on\\n  first, then the supporting message, then the CTA.\\n- Keep strong figure/ground contrast. If text sits over imagery, place a scrim or\\n  overlay behind it so it stays fully legible.\\n- Place the focal subject on a rule-of-thirds line; leave generous whitespace and\\n  avoid clutter.\\n- Use a limited palette anchored to the brand colors (~60-30-10), reserving one\\n  accent color for the call to action.\\n- Keep 20% space all around the creative for the ad to look cleaner\\n- Group and align elements cleanly (Gestalt); use at most two type styles.\",\"status\":\"generated\",\"createdBy\":\"f5dfb377-dac7-46a6-aea3-a4e04cb45e54\",\"metadata\":{\"brief\":\"Using the Problem-Agitate-Solve (PAS) framework, this concept targets the daily routine friction of mothers finding half-eaten, soggy food returned in school lunchboxes. The visual is a warm, high-definition, in-context lifestyle photo of a modern, organized kitchen counter. An open, stainless steel tiffin box is the hero, featuring a compartment packed with crisp, intact, rectangular golden-yellow khakhra crackers, arranged alongside fresh baby carrots and cucumber slices, with the clean Essen Root olive-khaki pouch sitting elegantly in the soft-focus background. The visual hero is the perfect, mess-free tiffin-box solution that kids love. The short on-image headline is 'No more empty school tiffin boxes.' The soft call to action is 'See how it works' styled inside a minimalist Action Blue (#0d6efd) bordered button with 6px rounded corners. To stay on-brand, keep the scene brightly lit with natural light, use clean geometric sans-serif typography, and ensure the background elements remain uncluttered and structured.\",\"prompt\":\"Instructions by the director: Using the Problem-Agitate-Solve (PAS) framework, this concept targets the daily routine friction of mothers finding half-eaten, soggy food returned in school lunchboxes. The visual is a warm, high-definition, in-context lifestyle photo of a modern, organized kitchen counter. An open, stainless steel tiffin box is the hero, featuring a compartment packed with crisp, intact, rectangular golden-yellow khakhra crackers, arranged alongside fresh baby carrots and cucumber slices, with the clean Essen Root olive-khaki pouch sitting elegantly in the soft-focus background. The visual hero is the perfect, mess-free tiffin-box solution that kids love. The short on-image headline is 'No more empty school tiffin boxes.' The soft call to action is 'See how it works' styled inside a minimalist Action Blue (#0d6efd) bordered button with 6px rounded corners. To stay on-brand, keep the scene brightly lit with natural light, use clean geometric sans-serif typography, and ensure the background elements remain uncluttered and structured.\\n\\nProduct appearance: The product is a roasted methi khakhra, a thin Indian flatbread cracker, packaged in a matte-finish, light olive-khaki stand-up pouch. The actual crackers, as seen unpacked, are ultra-thin, flat, and rectangular with rounded corners, featuring a crisp, matte, and slightly bubbled texture; they have a warm, toasted golden-yellow to deep ochre-orange hue, speckled with fine, dark green dried fenugreek leaf flecks and occasional small, charred brown spots. The heat-sealed, zip-lock pouch features dual tear notches at the top. Its front panel displays bold, dark brown, sans-serif branding that reads \\\"ROASTED METHI KHAKHRA\\\" above \\\"CRISPY & NUTRITIOUS FLATREADS\\\" on the left, alongside three functional icon callouts (\\\"HIGH FIBRE\\\", \\\"READY TO EAT\\\", \\\"SUPERGRAIN POWER\\\") and a cartoon illustration of a smiling young girl with brown pigtails in an orange shirt eating a cracker. To the right of the text is a circular graphic containing fan-sliced wedges of a round, herb-speckled khakhra, which contrasts with the rectangular shape of the actual loose crackers. A dark brown horizontal banner at the bottom reads \\\"MADE WITH REAL FENUGREEK LEAVES\\\" next to a circular \\\"Net Wt. 130g\\\" badge. The back of the pouch organizes detailed nutritional and ingredient tables on the upper half, manufacturer details and a circular icon graphic in the middle, and a dedicated white block at the bottom containing a QR code, barcode, and product specifications including a printed net weight of 120g.\\n\\nUse the product appearance text only as a private visual reference for accurately drawing the product. Do not print, quote, paraphrase, label, or turn any of that description into ad copy. Treat orientation-specific details carefully: show front-only details only when the product front is visible; if the brief shows the back, side, top, or an angled view where those details would not be visible, omit them instead of moving them onto the wrong face.\\n\\nThe attached product photos show the real product — reproduce it faithfully.\\n\\nThe final attached image is the official brand logo. Add it once, subtly, in clean negative space; keep it exact, legible, and uncropped.\\n\\nDesign requirements (apply to this ad):\\n- Follow the instructions by the director.\\n- Make the ad design, layout, typography on-branded, but should look premium, editorial-like.\\n- Establish a clear visual hierarchy: one dominant focal point the eye lands on\\n  first, then the supporting message, then the CTA.\\n- Keep strong figure/ground contrast. If text sits over imagery, place a scrim or\\n  overlay behind it so it stays fully legible.\\n- Place the focal subject on a rule-of-thirds line; leave generous whitespace and\\n  avoid clutter.\\n- Use a limited palette anchored to the brand colors (~60-30-10), reserving one\\n  accent color for the call to action.\\n- Keep 20% space all around the creative for the ad to look cleaner\\n- Group and align elements cleanly (Gestalt); use at most two type styles.\",\"source\":\"campaign-creatives\",\"language\":\"English\",\"lastError\":null,\"imageModel\":\"gpt-image-2\",\"hasNSFWRisk\":false,\"imagePrompt\":\"Instructions by the director: Using the Problem-Agitate-Solve (PAS) framework, this concept targets the daily routine friction of mothers finding half-eaten, soggy food returned in school lunchboxes. The visual is a warm, high-definition, in-context lifestyle photo of a modern, organized kitchen counter. An open, stainless steel tiffin box is the hero, featuring a compartment packed with crisp, intact, rectangular golden-yellow khakhra crackers, arranged alongside fresh baby carrots and cucumber slices, with the clean Essen Root olive-khaki pouch sitting elegantly in the soft-focus background. The visual hero is the perfect, mess-free tiffin-box solution that kids love. The short on-image headline is 'No more empty school tiffin boxes.' The soft call to action is 'See how it works' styled inside a minimalist Action Blue (#0d6efd) bordered button with 6px rounded corners. To stay on-brand, keep the scene brightly lit with natural light, use clean geometric sans-serif typography, and ensure the background elements remain uncluttered and structured.\\n\\nProduct appearance: The product is a roasted methi khakhra, a thin Indian flatbread cracker, packaged in a matte-finish, light olive-khaki stand-up pouch. The actual crackers, as seen unpacked, are ultra-thin, flat, and rectangular with rounded corners, featuring a crisp, matte, and slightly bubbled texture; they have a warm, toasted golden-yellow to deep ochre-orange hue, speckled with fine, dark green dried fenugreek leaf flecks and occasional small, charred brown spots. The heat-sealed, zip-lock pouch features dual tear notches at the top. Its front panel displays bold, dark brown, sans-serif branding that reads \\\"ROASTED METHI KHAKHRA\\\" above \\\"CRISPY & NUTRITIOUS FLATREADS\\\" on the left, alongside three functional icon callouts (\\\"HIGH FIBRE\\\", \\\"READY TO EAT\\\", \\\"SUPERGRAIN POWER\\\") and a cartoon illustration of a smiling young girl with brown pigtails in an orange shirt eating a cracker. To the right of the text is a circular graphic containing fan-sliced wedges of a round, herb-speckled khakhra, which contrasts with the rectangular shape of the actual loose crackers. A dark brown horizontal banner at the bottom reads \\\"MADE WITH REAL FENUGREEK LEAVES\\\" next to a circular \\\"Net Wt. 130g\\\" badge. The back of the pouch organizes detailed nutritional and ingredient tables on the upper half, manufacturer details and a circular icon graphic in the middle, and a dedicated white block at the bottom containing a QR code, barcode, and product specifications including a printed net weight of 120g.\\n\\nUse the product appearance text only as a private visual reference for accurately drawing the product. Do not print, quote, paraphrase, label, or turn any of that description into ad copy. Treat orientation-specific details carefully: show front-only details only when the product front is visible; if the brief shows the back, side, top, or an angled view where those details would not be visible, omit them instead of moving them onto the wrong face.\\n\\nThe attached product photos show the real product — reproduce it faithfully.\\n\\nThe final attached image is the official brand logo. Add it once, subtly, in clean negative space; keep it exact, legible, and uncropped.\\n\\nDesign requirements (apply to this ad):\\n- Follow the instructions by the director.\\n- Make the ad design, layout, typography on-branded, but should look premium, editorial-like.\\n- Establish a clear visual hierarchy: one dominant focal point the eye lands on\\n  first, then the supporting message, then the CTA.\\n- Keep strong figure/ground contrast. If text sits over imagery, place a scrim or\\n  overlay behind it so it stays fully legible.\\n- Place the focal subject on a rule-of-thirds line; leave generous whitespace and\\n  avoid clutter.\\n- Use a limited palette anchored to the brand colors (~60-30-10), reserving one\\n  accent color for the call to action.\\n- Keep 20% space all around the creative for the ad to look cleaner\\n- Group and align elements cleanly (Gestalt); use at most two type styles.\",\"brandLogoUrl\":\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/brand-logos/32fa1d3d-9b2a-43e0-a393-7a3e95511f54/569c1fa7-5d60-407d-b6a6-33020620ec35.png\",\"imageProvider\":\"azure-openai\",\"imageGeneratorId\":\"openai/gpt-image-2\",\"productImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42/1786814222356-0d21d0ea-ac3e-4d17-b546-801a8cb1c8f6.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42/1786814222056-2fffcf0a-4d23-4885-8aef-a9706ccb3d71.jpg\"],\"providerRequestId\":\"cc399eec-4fd8-44f5-98a0-a20c88252d25\",\"visualDescription\":\"The product is a roasted methi khakhra, a thin Indian flatbread cracker, packaged in a matte-finish, light olive-khaki stand-up pouch. The actual crackers, as seen unpacked, are ultra-thin, flat, and rectangular with rounded corners, featuring a crisp, matte, and slightly bubbled texture; they have a warm, toasted golden-yellow to deep ochre-orange hue, speckled with fine, dark green dried fenugreek leaf flecks and occasional small, charred brown spots. The heat-sealed, zip-lock pouch features dual tear notches at the top. Its front panel displays bold, dark brown, sans-serif branding that reads \\\"ROASTED METHI KHAKHRA\\\" above \\\"CRISPY & NUTRITIOUS FLATREADS