stration of a smiling young girl with brown pigtails in an orange shirt eating a cracker. To the right of the text is a circular graphic containing fan-sliced wedges of a round, herb-speckled khakhra, which contrasts with the rectangular shape of the actual loose crackers. A dark brown horizontal banner at the bottom reads \\\"MADE WITH REAL FENUGREEK LEAVES\\\" next to a circular \\\"Net Wt. 130g\\\" badge. The back of the pouch organizes detailed nutritional and ingredient tables on the upper half, manufacturer details and a circular icon graphic in the middle, and a dedicated white block at the bottom containing a QR code, barcode, and product specifications including a printed net weight of 120g.\\n\\nUse the product appearance text only as a private visual reference for accurately drawing the product. Do not print, quote, paraphrase, label, or turn any of that description into ad copy. Treat orientation-specific details carefully: show front-only details only when the product front is visible; if the brief shows the back, side, top, or an angled view where those details would not be visible, omit them instead of moving them onto the wrong face.\\n\\nThe attached product photos show the real product — reproduce it faithfully.\\n\\nThe final attached image is the official brand logo. Add it once, subtly, in clean negative space; keep it exact, legible, and uncropped.\\n\\nDesign requirements (apply to this ad):\\n- Follow the instructions by the director.\\n- Make the ad design, layout, typography on-branded, but should look premium, editorial-like.\\n- Establish a clear visual hierarchy: one dominant focal point the eye lands on\\n  first, then the supporting message, then the CTA.\\n- Keep strong figure/ground contrast. If text sits over imagery, place a scrim or\\n  overlay behind it so it stays fully legible.\\n- Place the focal subject on a rule-of-thirds line; leave generous whitespace and\\n  avoid clutter.\\n- Use a limited palette anchored to the brand colors (~60-30-10), reserving one\\n  accent color for the call to action.\\n- Keep 20% space all around the creative for the ad to look cleaner\\n- Group and align elements cleanly (Gestalt); use at most two type styles.\",\"brandLogoUrl\":\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/brand-logos/32fa1d3d-9b2a-43e0-a393-7a3e95511f54/569c1fa7-5d60-407d-b6a6-33020620ec35.png\",\"imageProvider\":\"openai\",\"productImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42/1786814222356-0d21d0ea-ac3e-4d17-b546-801a8cb1c8f6.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42/1786814222056-2fffcf0a-4d23-4885-8aef-a9706ccb3d71.jpg\"],\"visualDescription\":\"The product is a roasted methi khakhra, a thin Indian flatbread cracker, packaged in a matte-finish, light olive-khaki stand-up pouch. The actual crackers, as seen unpacked, are ultra-thin, flat, and rectangular with rounded corners, featuring a crisp, matte, and slightly bubbled texture; they have a warm, toasted golden-yellow to deep ochre-orange hue, speckled with fine, dark green dried fenugreek leaf flecks and occasional small, charred brown spots. The heat-sealed, zip-lock pouch features dual tear notches at the top. Its front panel displays bold, dark brown, sans-serif branding that reads \\\"ROASTED METHI KHAKHRA\\\" above \\\"CRISPY & NUTRITIOUS FLATREADS\\\" on the left, alongside three functional icon callouts (\\\"HIGH FIBRE\\\", \\\"READY TO EAT\\\", \\\"SUPERGRAIN POWER\\\") and a cartoon illustration of a smiling young girl with brown pigtails in an orange shirt eating a cracker. To the right of the text is a circular graphic containing fan-sliced wedges of a round, herb-speckled khakhra, which contrasts with the rectangular shape of the actual loose crackers. A dark brown horizontal banner at the bottom reads \\\"MADE WITH REAL FENUGREEK LEAVES\\\" next to a circular \\\"Net Wt. 130g\\\" badge. The back of the pouch organizes detailed nutritional and ingredient tables on the upper half, manufacturer details and a circular icon graphic in the middle, and a dedicated white block at the bottom containing a QR code, barcode, and product specifications including a printed net weight of 120g.\",\"referenceImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42/1786814222356-0d21d0ea-ac3e-4d17-b546-801a8cb1c8f6.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42/1786814222056-2fffcf0a-4d23-4885-8aef-a9706ccb3d71.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/brand-logos/32fa1d3d-9b2a-43e0-a393-7a3e95511f54/569c1fa7-5d60-407d-b6a6-33020620ec35.png\"],\"referenceAdImageUrls\":[],\"originalReferenceImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42/1786814222356-0d21d0ea-ac3e-4d17-b546-801a8cb1c8f6.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42/1786814222056-2fffcf0a-4d23-4885-8aef-a9706ccb3d71.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/brand-logos/32fa1d3d-9b2a-43e0-a393-7a3e95511f54/569c1fa7-5d60-407d-b6a6-33020620ec35.png\"]},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T17:18:18.741Z\"},\"viewerFeedback\":null},{\"id\":\"b128a159-95be-44ba-ac60-ea0fc15967f2\",\"orgId\":\"62f84ee9-c45f-4e41-8868-bcf0bb1ec033\",\"offeringId\":\"2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42\",\"strategyRunId\":null,\"generationJobId\":\"c0ad420a-cbe6-43fd-9422-469341798623\",\"triggerRunId\":null,\"audienceNodeId\":null,\"angleNodeId\":null,\"campaignId\":\"065d84eb-bf03-47bf-87d5-85e86dcb67d6\",\"adAudienceId\":\"d92add18-d836-4eca-949f-ccbf7d7f2a1a\",\"campaignAngleId\":null,\"promptRecipeId\":null,\"currentVersionId\":\"f0509c54-c0e0-4b4b-b36d-069f9a331d3e\",\"storageKey\":\"campaign-creatives/065d84eb-bf03-47bf-87d5-85e86dcb67d6/93e0a3ad-9d60-4d9f-8c15-7737e41c5b30.png\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/campaign-creatives/065d84eb-bf03-47bf-87d5-85e86dcb67d6/93e0a3ad-9d60-4d9f-8c15-7737e41c5b30.png\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/campaign-creatives/065d84eb-bf03-47bf-87d5-85e86dcb67d6/93e0a3ad-9d60-4d9f-8c15-7737e41c5b30.png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"width\":1024,\"height\":1024,\"finalImagePrompt\":null,\"status\":\"generated\",\"downloadCount\":0,\"metadata\":{\"brief\":\"Using the Attention-Interest-Desire-Action (AIDA) framework, this ad targets the conscious mother's values of clean-label transparency and honest ingredients. The visual is a minimalist, flat-lay graphic shot against a clean, off-white Soft Cloud (#f8f9fa) background. The visual hero is the clean ingredient list on the back of the Essen Root pack, with the package slightly turned to reveal both the appetizing front cartoon girl illustration and the clear ingredient table, where 'Bajara, Ragi, Jowar' are subtly highlighted with a thin, professional Action Blue (#0d6efd) circle. Scattered around the pouch are a few whole, ultra-thin, golden-orange rectangular crackers speckled with real green fenugreek leaves. The short on-image headline is 'Honest ingredients. Zero chemical preservatives.' The call to action is 'Explore the collection' in a clean Deep Onyx (#212529) sans-serif font. Brand consistency is maintained by keeping the layout strictly geometric, avoiding hand-drawn decorations, ensuring text occupies less than 20 percent of the image, and using precise, thin 1px borders.\",\"prompt\":\"Instructions by the director: Using the Attention-Interest-Desire-Action (AIDA) framework, this ad targets the conscious mother's values of clean-label transparency and honest ingredients. The visual is a minimalist, flat-lay graphic shot against a clean, off-white Soft Cloud (#f8f9fa) background. The visual hero is the clean ingredient list on the back of the Essen Root pack, with the package slightly turned to reveal both the appetizing front cartoon girl illustration and the clear ingredient table, where 'Bajara, Ragi, Jowar' are subtly highlighted with a thin, professional Action Blue (#0d6efd) circle. Scattered around the pouch are a few whole, ultra-thin, golden-orange rectangular crackers speckled with real green fenugreek leaves. The short on-image headline is 'Honest ingredients. Zero chemical preservatives.' The call to action is 'Explore the collection' in a clean Deep Onyx (#212529) sans-serif font. Brand consistency is maintained by keeping the layout strictly geometric, avoiding hand-drawn decorations, ensuring text occupies less than 20 percent of the image, and using precise, thin 1px borders.\\n\\nProduct appearance: The product is a roasted methi khakhra, a thin Indian flatbread cracker, packaged in a matte-finish, light olive-khaki stand-up pouch. The actual crackers, as seen unpacked, are ultra-thin, flat, and rectangular with rounded corners, featuring a crisp, matte, and slightly bubbled texture; they have a warm, toasted golden-yellow to deep ochre-orange hue, speckled with fine, dark green dried fenugreek leaf flecks and occasional small, charred brown spots. The heat-sealed, zip-lock pouch features dual tear notches at the top. Its front panel displays bold, dark brown, sans-serif branding that reads \\\"ROASTED METHI KHAKHRA\\\" above \\\"CRISPY & NUTRITIOUS FLATREADS\\\" on the left, alongside three functional icon callouts (\\\"HIGH FIBRE\\\", \\\"READY TO EAT\\\", \\\"SUPERGRAIN POWER\\\") and a cartoon illustration of a smiling young girl with brown pigtails in an orange shirt eating a cracker. To the right of the text is a circular graphic containing fan-sliced wedges of a round, herb-speckled khakhra, which contrasts with the rectangular shape of the actual loose crackers. A dark brown horizontal banner at the bottom reads \\\"MADE WITH REAL FENUGREEK LEAVES\\\" next to a circular \\\"Net Wt. 130g\\\" badge. The back of the pouch organizes detailed nutritional and ingredient tables on the upper half, manufacturer details and a circular icon graphic in the middle, and a dedicated white block at the bottom containing a QR code, barcode, and product specifications including a printed net weight of 120g.\\n\\nUse the product appearance text only as a private visual reference for accurately drawing the product. Do not print, quote, paraphrase, label, or turn any of that description into ad copy. Treat orientation-specific details carefully: show front-only details only when the product front is visible; if the brief shows the back, side, top, or an angled view where those details would not be visible, omit them instead of moving them onto the wrong face.\\n\\nThe attached product photos show the real product — reproduce it faithfully.\\n\\nThe final attached image is the official brand logo. Add it once, subtly, in clean negative space; keep it exact, legible, and uncropped.\\n\\nDesign requirements (apply to this ad):\\n- Follow the instructions by the director.\\n- Make the ad design, layout, typography on-branded, but should look premium, editorial-like.\\n- Establish a clear visual hierarchy: one dominant focal point the eye lands on\\n  first, then the supporting message, then the CTA.\\n- Keep strong figure/ground contrast. If text sits over imagery, place a scrim or\\n  overlay behind it so it stays fully legible.\\n- Place the focal subject on a rule-of-thirds line; leave generous whitespace and\\n  avoid clutter.\\n- Use a limited palette anchored to the brand colors (~60-30-10), reserving one\\n  accent color for the call to action.\\n- Keep 20% space all around the creative for the ad to look cleaner\\n- Group and align elements cleanly (Gestalt); use at most two type styles.\",\"source\":\"campaign-creatives\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/campaign-creatives/065d84eb-bf03-47bf-87d5-85e86dcb67d6/93e0a3ad-9d60-4d9f-8c15-7737e41c5b30.png\",\"language\":\"English\",\"lastError\":null,\"hasNSFWRisk\":false,\"brandLogoUrl\":\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/brand-logos/32fa1d3d-9b2a-43e0-a393-7a3e95511f54/569c1fa7-5d6