tos show the real product — reproduce it faithfully.\\n\\nThe final attached image is the official brand logo. Add it once, subtly, in clean negative space; keep it exact, legible, and uncropped.\\n\\nDesign requirements (apply to this ad):\\n- Follow the instructions by the director.\\n- Make the ad design, layout, typography on-branded, but should look premium, editorial-like.\\n- Establish a clear visual hierarchy: one dominant focal point the eye lands on\\n  first, then the supporting message, then the CTA.\\n- Keep strong figure/ground contrast. If text sits over imagery, place a scrim or\\n  overlay behind it so it stays fully legible.\\n- Place the focal subject on a rule-of-thirds line; leave generous whitespace and\\n  avoid clutter.\\n- Use a limited palette anchored to the brand colors (~60-30-10), reserving one\\n  accent color for the call to action.\\n- Keep 20% space all around the creative for the ad to look cleaner\\n- Group and align elements cleanly (Gestalt); use at most two type styles.\",\"brandLogoUrl\":\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/brand-logos/32fa1d3d-9b2a-43e0-a393-7a3e95511f54/569c1fa7-5d60-407d-b6a6-33020620ec35.png\",\"imageProvider\":\"openai\",\"productImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42/1786814222356-0d21d0ea-ac3e-4d17-b546-801a8cb1c8f6.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/2ab4280f-9d19-4903-8ce0-883d13b4de42/1786814222056-2fffcf0a-4d23-4885-8aef-a9706ccb3d71.jpg\"],\"visualDescription\":\"The product is a roasted methi khakhra, a thin Indian flatbread cracker, packaged in a matte-finish, light olive-khaki stand-up pouch. The actual crackers, as seen unpacked, are ultra-thin, flat, and rectangular with rounded corners, featuring a crisp, matte, and slightly bubbled texture; they have a warm, toasted golden-yellow to deep ochre-orange hue, speckled with fine, dark green dried fenugreek leaf flecks and occasional small, charred brown spots. The heat-se